<FBType Name="A2X2_SPLIT_FWD_REV" Comment="A2X2 passthrough (Socket zu Plug) plus 2 A2X Plugs, die den Vorwaerts- und den&#10;Rueckwaerts-Kanal spiegeln">
	<Identification Standard="61499-2" Function="IN -&gt; OUT unveraendert, zusaetzlich an FWD_OUT gespiegelt. OUT -&gt; IN (Rueckwaerts) unveraendert, zusaetzlich an REV_OUT gespiegelt." Description="Copyright (c) 2026 HR Agrartechnik GmbH  &#10; &#10;This program and the accompanying materials are made  &#10;available under the terms of the Eclipse Public License 2.0  &#10;which is available at https://www.eclipse.org/legal/epl-2.0/  &#10; &#10;SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0">
